{"id":"k9u29jh850h06zma2jsnvy51i","title":"NIH 的传染病单位终于有了新主任","originalTitle":"NIH’s infectious disease unit has a new head at last","summary":"NIH 的传染病单位自 2025 年以来一直空缺，现在由约翰·波尔斯三世接任。波尔斯曾担任该机构的代理主任，并在一篇论文中建议 NIAID 应从专注于 HIV 和大流行病准备转向更广泛的传染病和免疫学领域。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"STAT News"},"links":{"original":"https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/17/health-news-nih-infectious-disease-unit-has-a-new-head-at-last/?utm_campaign=rss"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T13:27:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T13:32:26.310Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T13:32:26.310Z","category":"clinical","tags":["人物变动","NIH"],"score":33,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"092ebf5b-6b8a-416c-8b4d-7a627e2f9361","title":"NIH任命新传染病部门负责人，填补两年空缺"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Amanda Erickson","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"092ebf5b-6b8a-416c-8b4d-7a627e2f9361","title":"NIH任命新传染病部门负责人，填补两年空缺"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nih","name":"NIH"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fThqTEPi8Q8w","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}